WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.794
Hello everyone, it's Logan Marmino.

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:04.630
-This is...
-Peyton Jackson.

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:07.049
And I play Kyle, Logan's best friend.

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:10.594
It makes me feel so much better
walking with the mayor of middle school.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.639
Oh, kids don't really call me
by that nickname that much.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:16.266
It's more like a... informal title.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:21.438
Hi, I am Roger Dale Floyd,
and I play the role of Matthew Dubin.

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:23.315
I'm here. Now the fun can start!

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.858
We just joke around.

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:26.902
-Dancing.
-Dancing.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.028
Lot of ridiculous stuff.

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:35.452
-And this is...
-Trinity Bliss.

00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:37.329
-And she plays Gabriella.
-Gabriella.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.413
Gabriella Decker?

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:39.414
Josh Dubin.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:40.624
How do you know who I am?

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.042
I memorized the yearbook.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:42.709
Okay.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:45.838
Today we are filming
a scene from "Field Day."

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.924
And I get to incapacitate them
with dodgeballs.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:49.633
Seriously?

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.885
-You haven't hurt yourself yet, have you?
-No.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:54.638
But the day is still young,
and full of possibilities.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.058
Do you guys remember
the Halloween episode?

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:00.644
Some of those costumes were awesome.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.855
Oh, yeah, do you guys remember
the moon costume?

00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:03.981
Golf ball with a face.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.107
Is he serious?

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.777
I am the moon from the classic 1902 film
"A Trip to the Moon."

00:01:08.861 --> 00:01:10.445
And you expected us to know that?

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:12.322
My mummy costume.

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:16.410
They had to wrap this
big piece of clothing in toilet paper.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.579
He was, like, in the walkie-talkie,
he was, like,

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:20.497
"Roger on the move. Roger on the move.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:22.457
We cannot get him on the move.
It's gonna rip. It's gonna rip."

00:01:24.543 --> 00:01:26.628
Gabriella had two costumes.

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:28.881
She had her fun Sriracha bottle costume

00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:32.551
and she had her cute volleyball,
fit in with my friends,

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.345
like, red t-shirt, red skirt,
that said "Hot Sauce."

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:38.432
You can tell which one I like better.

00:01:41.602 --> 00:01:43.312
Ah, they're ready for us. See you later!

00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:44.396
-Bye!
-See ya.

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:46.565
So Logan, tell us about where we are.

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:48.609
We're at the school!

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:51.111
How's this compare to
your guys' real school?

00:01:51.195 --> 00:01:53.030
-I'm home schooled, so...
-Same.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.531
A lot bigger than my house.

00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:57.701
Do you guys feel like
you relate to the Dubins?

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.494
As a home school family?

00:02:00.037 --> 00:02:01.246
-Yes.
-Well, yeah.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.707
Public school's going to be
challenging for you

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.793
in ways you can't even imagine.

00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:09.004
Then maybe I need
to find that out for myself.

00:02:09.505 --> 00:02:10.464
Yeah, okay.

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:13.425
-We're going to public school!
-We're going to public school!

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:16.220
This show has just been
so much fun for me to work on.

00:02:16.303 --> 00:02:17.804
I just love the cast and crew.

00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:19.765
Everyone on this show is so brilliant.

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:22.935
When I go home every night,
I just feel such a happiness in my heart.

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:27.147
This show is just so awesome,

00:02:27.231 --> 00:02:30.359
and the number one reason
I wanted to be a part of this

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:33.153
is to spread awareness for amputees,

00:02:33.237 --> 00:02:36.573
and for people that are not amputees,

00:02:36.657 --> 00:02:39.826
to get to know that
we're really no different than them.

00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:42.538
Josh, you don't have to be so brave.

00:02:42.621 --> 00:02:44.331
I just don't want any special treatment.

00:02:44.414 --> 00:02:46.041
I wanna be treated like everybody else.

00:02:46.124 --> 00:02:49.169
Josh, Josh.
You're being rude to the principal.

00:02:49.253 --> 00:02:51.338
If anybody treats you any different
because of your leg,

00:02:51.964 --> 00:02:53.423
you come talk to me.

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:55.676
People never get the irony.

00:02:55.759 --> 00:02:57.803
This whole entire story is just amazing.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:03:00.138
It's been amazing
to be a part of this cast, honestly.

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:05.644
-Love you guys. Group hug.
-Yeah...

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.145
All right, back to set. Bye guys!

00:03:07.229 --> 00:03:08.605
-Back to set!
-Bye!

00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:10.232
That was awesome!

